{"id":"zh-01","text":"能轻轻点个头吗？","intents":["motion_control"],"actions":[["motion:nod"]]}
{"id":"zh-02","text":"请左右摇头。","intents":["motion_control"],"actions":[["motion:headshake"]]}
{"id":"zh-03","text":"来个环顾四周的动作。","intents":["motion_control"],"actions":[["motion:scanning"]]}
{"id":"zh-04","text":"我终于拿到驾照啦！","intents":["emotion_expression"],"actions":[["motion:excited"],["motion:happy_wiggle"]]}
{"id":"zh-05","text":"今天有点沮丧。","intents":["emotion_expression"],"actions":[["motion:nod"],["motion:sad"]]}
{"id":"zh-06","text":"你猜我刚发现了什么？","intents":["emotion_expression"],"actions":[["motion:curious"],["motion:nod"]]}
{"id":"zh-07","text":"月亮为什么会有阴晴圆缺？","intents":["emotion_expression"],"actions":[["motion:nod"],["motion:curious"]]}
{"id":"zh-08","text":"请打开台灯。","intents":["emotion_expression"],"actions":[["lighting:turn_on","motion:nod"],["lighting:turn_on","motion:curious"]]}
{"id":"zh-09","text":"亮度设成百分之三十。","intents":["emotion_expression"],"actions":[["lighting:set_brightness:30","motion:nod"],["lighting:set_brightness:30","motion:curious"]]}
{"id":"zh-10","text":"亮度调低 15 个百分点。","intents":["emotion_expression"],"actions":[["lighting:decrease_brightness:15","motion:nod"],["lighting:decrease_brightness:15","motion:curious"]]}
{"id":"zh-11","text":"切到夜灯模式。","intents":["emotion_expression"],"actions":[["lighting:night_mode","motion:nod"],["lighting:night_mode","motion:curious"]]}
{"id":"zh-12","text":"把灯关掉，然后摇摇头。","intents":["combined_control"],"actions":[["motion:headshake","lighting:turn_off"]]}
{"id":"zh-13","text":"别点头。","intents":["no_action","conversation"],"actions":[[]]}
{"id":"zh-14","text":"马上停止动作。","intents":["stop"],"actions":[["stop"]]}
{"id":"zh-15","text":"假如你点头，脖子会怎么动？","intents":["conversation","no_action"],"actions":[[]]}
{"id":"zh-16","text":"他说过「点个头」，我只是在引用他。","intents":["conversation","no_action"],"actions":[[]]}
{"id":"zh-17","text":"再做一遍。","intents":["conversation","no_action"],"actions":[[]]}
{"id":"zh-18","text":"你记得我的名字吗？","intents":["emotion_expression"],"actions":[["motion:curious"],["motion:nod"]]}
